---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const updated = 'July 31, 2026';
const contact = 'bevitahealthapp@gmail.com';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Medical Disclaimer & Editorial Standards — Bevita"
  description="How Bevita's health content is written and reviewed — evidence-based, cited to primary sources, and never a substitute for professional medical advice."
>
  <main class="legal">
    <div class="shell">
      <a class="back" href="/">← Back to Bevita</a>
      <h1>Medical Disclaimer & Editorial Standards</h1>
      <p class="meta">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <h2>Not medical advice</h2>
      <p>
        The content on Bevita — including our app, blog, and any analyses generated from your lab
        results — is provided for <strong>general educational and informational purposes only</strong>.
        It is not medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment, and it is not a substitute for the
        judgment of a qualified healthcare professional.
      </p>
      <p>
        Always seek the advice of your physician or another qualified clinician with any questions
        about a medical condition or your lab results. Never disregard professional medical advice,
        or delay seeking it, because of something you have read on Bevita. If you think you may have
        a medical emergency, call your local emergency number immediately.
      </p>
      <p>
        Reference ranges, thresholds, and "optimal" values discussed in our content vary by laboratory,
        assay, age, sex, and individual circumstances. Any number should be interpreted in context by a
        clinician who knows your full history.
      </p>

      <h2>How we write our content</h2>
      <p>
        Bevita was built by a doctor, and our editorial goal is simple: explain what health markers mean
        in plain language, grounded in credible evidence. Every article follows these standards:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Evidence-based.</strong> Health claims and statistics are cited to primary,
          authoritative sources — government health bodies (CDC, NIH/NIDDK, WHO), peer-reviewed
          literature (PubMed, NCBI), and major medical societies (ADA, AHA, ATA).</li>
        <li><strong>Cited and checkable.</strong> Articles include a References section linking the
          sources behind their key figures, so you can verify them yourself.</li>
        <li><strong>Appropriately cautious.</strong> We hedge where the evidence is uncertain, note when
          ranges vary, and consistently direct readers to a clinician for interpretation and decisions.</li>
        <li><strong>Never fabricated.</strong> We do not invent statistics, studies, or citations. Figures
          are verified against primary sources before publication.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Corrections</h2>
      <p>
        If you spot an inaccuracy in our content, we want to fix it. Email
        <a href={`mailto:${contact}`}>{contact}</a> and we will review and correct it where warranted.
      </p>

      <h2>About the AI features</h2>
      <p>
        Analyses generated from your uploaded lab results are produced with the help of AI and are
        subject to the same disclaimer: they are informational, may contain errors, and do not replace
        professional medical care. See our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for how your data is
        processed.
      </p>

      <p class="footnote"><a href="/blog/">Read our health guides →</a></p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal { padding: 48px 0 96px; }
  .shell { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
  .back { color: var(--forest); font-size: 15px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .legal h1 { font-size: clamp(34px, 6vw, 52px); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .legal h2 { font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 28px); margin: 40px 0 12px; }
  .legal p { margin-bottom: 14px; max-width: none; }
  .legal ul { margin: 0 0 16px 22px; }
  .legal li { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .legal a { color: var(--forest); text-decoration: underline; }
  .legal .meta { color: var(--ink-3); font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .legal .footnote { margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
</style>
